  "goodToKnow": "Der Lehrplan is a school curriculum or syllabus: im Lehrplan stehen, den Lehrplan ändern. Because education is a Länder matter, each state has its own Lehrpläne, coordinated by the Kultusministerkonferenz (KMK), which leads to frequent calls for national standards. Der Stundenplan is the weekly timetable. Plural: die Lehrpläne."
